<title>BRAZIL: Brazil industry employment falls 0.4 pct - IBGE.</title>
<headline>Brazil industry employment falls 0.4 pct - IBGE.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian May industrial employment  fell 0.4 percent from April and 5.7 percent compared with May 1996,  the National Statistics Institute (IBGE) said.</p>
<p>Industrial employment fell 5.8 percent in the first five months of  1997 and 8.2 percent in the year to the end of May, the IBGE said  in a statement.</p>
